    "created_at": "2016-05-11T18:51:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-11T18:51:16Z",
    "body": "Why Location.prototype?\n\nIs it necessary for the global object to have immutable prototype, or it sufficient for the global proxy (i.e. the global this value) to have an immutable prototype? The global object can never be observed directly.\n\nIt does seem like Window.prototype is currently just an ordinary object, which is no good.\n",
