    "created_at": "2016-05-12T07:18:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-12T07:18:31Z",
    "body": "Looping in @bzbarsky and @heycam.\n1. Do we need this for workers?\n2. I'm guessing we have to do this through IDL? Given that's how we define the prototype object today.\n",
